              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuswiilile ijwi eli, nompwizi zya-Basani nomuli mucilundu caSamariya, nomupenzya bacete akumanikizya batengwana, nomwaambila balumi banu kuti, Kamuleta cakunywa, tunywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehova wakonkezya kubusalazi bwakwe kuti, Ncobeni mazuba ayoomusikila nimuti jatwe atulobyo, abaabo benu basyeede bati zubwe azizubyo zyanswi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela muyooinda kumazwazwa, umwi aumwi uyooya cakululama, elyo muyoosowegwa ku-Harmoni, mbwaamba Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
