        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakamusaala mbubonya mbuli kusaala Leza nkwaakasaazya Sodoma a-Gomora, alimwi mwaba mbuli cisisi cisikwidwe kumulilo. Nekubaboobo tamuna kuboola kulindime, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
