        {
          "text": "Amubone oyo uubumba zilundu akulenga muuwo, uulwiida muntu miyeeyo yakwe mbwiibede, uusizya mumuni wacifumo akulyataula amasena aakujulu aanyika. Izina lyakwe ngu-Jehova Leza wamakamu.",
